Solo cooking 5 rounds (mix of XP and permits)=
This method tries to finish Tempoross off in 5 rounds instead of the usual 3, resulting in 8,500–9,500 points (10–12 permits) per game.
This requires an almost-empty inventory and wasting as little fish as possible.
===Inventory & Equipment===
