27 or 28 free inventory spaces are required. Therefore, one needs the [[spirit angler's outfit]], [[Imcando hammer]] and an equippable harpoon or having started [[barbarian fishing]].

===Game strategy===
# The first round, fish and cook 26 or 27 harpoonfish.
## Fish and cook 7–10 harpoonfish.
## When the double spot spawns, go fish there.
## Tether when necessary, then cook when no double spots are available or when the inventory is (almost) full, and always fish at double spots.
## Only douse a fire if required to tether or fish at the double spot.
# Load the harpoonfish in the ammunition crate:
## First load 18 harpoonfish.
## Do something else (fill bucket or fix mast or stand still) to prevent wasting fish.
## Load the other 8 or 9 harpoonfish.
# Fish at the spirit pool until Tempoross resurfaces. The essence should then be <60%, preferably <50%.
# The second round, fish and cook 26 or 27  harpoonfish again.
# Load the harpoonfish.
#* If Tempoross's energy starts at 49%, load 9 fish, then wait a second and load 17 fish (possibly keeping one fish if one has caught 27 fish both rounds).
#* If Tempoross's energy is 55%, load 10 fish, then wait a second and load 17 fish.
#* The goal is to leave Tempoross one hit from death to minimise its specials
# Do ''not'' fish at the spirit pool after the second round, but directly fish for harpoonfish instead (unless the first round the essence remained >60%, then fish until it is about <55%).
# The third round, drop the bucket, and catch and cook 28 fish.
#* If some fire is burning around the fishing spots, take ~10 buckets on the ship and douse those flames. Then drop the buckets while walking between fishing spots and shrine.
#* Because Tempoross should be at ≤10% energy, no special attacks should occur this round.
# Load exactly enough fish in the ammunition crates
## Load the first fish, then wait a second until Tempoross goes under.
## Put 5 harpoonfish in one crate and 13 in the other. The goal is to effectively stack out Tempoross immediately or the storm will end the match.
## '''Retain 9 harpoonfish '''.
# Again, do ''not'' go for the spirit pool, but directly fish for harpoonfish.
# Catch and cook 9 more harpoonfish while Tempoross is regaining energy. (or whatever you need to get to 18 total fish)
#* Do not try to fish at double spots; these disappear when Tempoross goes under.
