Solo no cooking (max XP)=
This method involves maximising fishing experience rates by never cooking any harpoonfish, while always keeping Tempoross at low energy to prevent special attacks.<br>
Using the "Solo-Start" right click option, you can expect roughly 100,000 Fishing experience per hour with a crystal harpoon (85k xp/hr with a dragon harpoon) and around 24 reward permits per hour.
===Equipment===
The only required equipment is the [[spirit angler's outfit]] or [[angler's outfit]] and a [[crystal harpoon]] or [[Dragon Harpoon]] (plus an [[elven signet]] is highly recommended). Other item slots may be filled by any other equipment the player deems necessary, such as [[weight-reducing clothing]], [[ring of endurance]], or [[explorer's ring]]s.
