===Game strategy===
Pregame, right-click the rope ladder and select Solo-start.  

Trip 1:
# Quickly run to the island and begin fishing.
# Catch 26 [[raw harpoonfish]] and/or [[crystallised harpoonfish]] (they're interchangeable), prioritizing the double fish spot. Tether to the totem if needed.
# Run to the ship and deposit the fish, tethering to the  mast if needed. To handle the flame: grab 5 buckets, cast [[Humidify]] or fill them with the water pump, then douse the flame.
# (If you have the Spirit Angler set: instead use the pre-filled bucket in your inventory, then grab the 5 buckets after you're finished loading.)
Trip 2:
# Go back to the island and douse the nearby flames. (Spirit Angler: You can click on a flame and then cast humidify as you're running to save time)
# Drop everything except your rune pouch.
# Fish 27 more harpoonfish.
# Deposit all 27 fish, then quickly go to the [[spirit pool]] and fish from it.
Trip 3:
# Fish 27 harpoonfish.
# Deposit 3 harpoonfish, then click off and quickly go to the Spirit Pool.
# Fish at the [[spirit pool]] until about 10% Essence, then click off and go back to the cannons.
# Deposit your remaining 24 harpoonfish (A colossal wave may occur around this point, which can be ignored.)
Trip 4:
# Fish 27 harpoonfish.
# Deposit all the harpoonfish, then quickly run to the [[spirit pool]] and finish off Tempoross.
# If you don't have the spirit angler outfit, grab a rope from the ship.
# If you do have the spirit angler outfit, grab one bucket near the spirit pool and fill it with humidify or the water pump.
# Select "Leave" on a Spirit Angler NPC.
</tabber>

